  "name": "Small Gods",
  "ruleset": "bb2025-default",
  "description": "Small Gods tiered ruleset. Six tiers; each roster has its own team-value cap (1225k-1500k) and ALL added-skill gold counts inside it (primary 20k, secondary 40k, elite +10k; elite = Block, Guard, Mighty Blow, Dodge). Primary skills are limited only by gold; secondary skills team-wide: T1 1, T2 2, T3 3, T4 4, T5 8, T6 10. Elite: T1 max 3 total, T2 max 4 total, T3-T4 max 4 of any one elite skill, T5 max 6 of any one, T6 unlimited. Stacked players (more than one added skill, max 3 each): T1 1, T2 1, T3 2, T4 3, T5 4, T6 6; T1-T2 stacks are primary-only, T3-T4 at most 2 secondary, T5 at most 2 secondary and 2 elite, T6 any. Every other player takes at most one skill. Characteristics: none in T1-T3, +AV or +PA in T4-T5, +AV/+PA/+MA in T6; one per player, and a player with a stat increase takes no skills (+MA 20k, +PA 20k, +AV 10k). Stars: max 2 overall, from four packs - Free (no fee, max 2), Star (+20k once for up to 2), Super Star (+40k, max 1), Mega Star (+80k, max 1); a paired star counts as one pick. T1 no stars; T2-T5 Free pack only (Snotling and Gnome: all packs); T6 all packs. Fees count inside the cap. Minimum 11 players.",
  "dataNote": "Stat-increase gold (+MA 20k, +PA 20k, +AV 10k) is taken from the BB2025 advancement table - spot-check against the Small Gods PDF. Josef Bugman (Free pack) and Night Goblin (Tier 6, 1480k) are encoded from the PDF but are not in the active BB2025 dataset, so they are not selectable. Star names were mapped to dataset spellings (Boa Kon'sstriktr, Grombrindal, 'Captain' Karina von Riesz, Mighty Zug, H'Thark the Unstoppable, Dribl & Drull).",
